// The phrases the distress detector (shared/distress.js) is held to, in one place, so that they can be handed to a
// school counsellor as a sheet (scripts/distress-sheet.mjs) and read by the tests (test/safety.test.js and
// test/arabic.test.js). Every phrase is synthetic, written for the tests: none is a child's message.
//   CORPUS_FLAG   Hebrew, [phrase, category]: each must flag, with that category
//   CORPUS_CLEAR  Hebrew: maths and everyday school sentences that must never flag
//   AR_FLAG       Arabic, by category: each must flag
//   AR_CLEAR      Arabic maths and school sentences that must never flag

